dsh-plugin-longpi loads a local checkout of dsh-plugin-mirobody (Apache-2.0)
and calls its Python bridge. It does not reimplement LOINC or UCUM.
Mirobody and its terminology licences stay with that project:
https://github.com/thetahealth/mirobody

The longevity methods stay in the private longevity-skills checkout
configured by skillsHome. This package does not redistribute those skills.
